{"id":63,"doub_id":63,"title":"假期历险记","years":"2015","class":"喜剧","image":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2258450504.webp","doub_score":7.3,"IMDB_number":"","IMDB_score":null,"edit":"","bianji":"[]","performer":"","language":"","release":"","alias":"","abstract":"鲁斯蒂（艾德·赫尔姆斯 Ed Helms 饰）和妻子黛比（克里斯蒂娜·艾伯盖特 Christina Applegate 饰）结婚多年，两人共同养育了两个孩子詹姆斯（斯凯勒·吉桑多 Skyler Gisondo 饰）和凯文（斯蒂尔·斯特宾斯 Steele Stebbins 饰），随着时间的流逝，激情渐渐淡漠，鲁斯蒂决定带着家人一起驱车前往亲子圣地威利鹿乐园，以修补彼此之间的亲情。\n　　就这样，一家人上路了，迎接他们的，是各种各样的挫折和意外，再加上鲁斯蒂的妹夫斯通（克里斯·海姆斯沃斯 Chris Hemsworth 饰）——一位“风情万种”的金发肌肉男的掺和，他们一行人真的能够顺利的抵达目的地吗，而这趟旅途所带来的结果，又是否能够如鲁斯蒂所愿呢？ ","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2258452780.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2258453006.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2258452914.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2258452022.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2258451239.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2258450504.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2364278627.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2633100522.webp\"]","myShareurl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1_toKhRHCe8T3lq0Lg-9mJQ?pwd=r8hi\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-30\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]","shareUrl":"[]","ecca":"null","all_seeds":"\"[]\"","duration":"","address":" 美国","orginName":"《假期历险记 Vacation》","ratingbetterthan":"","tag":""}